      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I didn't purchase that asset, but it seems to rely heavy on C# scripts, which means community modification is out of question. However community can create meshes and shaders. Thus I would prefer VRC_AudioSpectrum like component that sets shapekey values or material variables.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
