  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-08T21:12:05.608Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi devs & admins !\n\n\n\nI'd like to request the whitelisting of a unity package called \"SoundVizualizer-MeshDeform\" :\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/audio/sound-visualizer-mesh-deformation-95159\n\n\n\n It is basically a package containing several scripts allowing spectrum based mesh deformation. It is composed of :\n\n-  AudioScroll:  tracks the timeline of the song\n- AudioPeer : script to put on the audio source which broadcasts some data extracted from the audio (volume, bands, frequencies, etc.)\n- RotOnAudio : makes the mesh rotate using AudioPeer data.\n- Several mesh based deformations using AudioPeer data.\n\nI would like to know if such integration was possible.",
